# <Prefix>: <imperative subject>

# Why this change is being made (the "why", not the "what"). Wrap at 72-100
# columns; the header itself must stay within 72 columns.

# Allowed prefixes:
#   App      application / executable (apps/)
#   Lib      library (src/, znx)
#   Render   rendering subsystem
#   Math     math and geometry
#   Test     tests
#   Docs     documentation
#   Build    build system (CMake, Conan, presets)
#   CI       continuous integration
#   Repo     repository meta (tooling, hooks, config)
#   Deps     dependency updates
#   Release  releases and versioning
#
# Example:
#   Render: add perspective-correct texture sampling
